cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "JS-RE-Bench: A Comprehensive Benchmark for JS/Web Reverse Engineering"
message: "If you use JS-RE-Bench in academic work, please cite this software."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "JS-RE-Bench Maintainers"
    given-names: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/js-re-bench/js-re-bench"
abstract: >-
  JS-RE-Bench extends JsDeObsBench into a unified, public, reproducible
  benchmark platform covering 18 reverse-engineering dimensions of
  JavaScript/Web protection schemes — including deobfuscation, JSVMP
  unpacking, anti-debug bypass, obfuscator correctness verification, and
  LLM semantic-understanding probing.
keywords:
  - reverse engineering
  - javascript
  - benchmark
  - llm evaluation
  - obfuscation
  - jsvmp
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-05-02"
